@{
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_MainLayout.cshtml";
}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="../Content/main-css/index.css">
<div class="d-flex justify-content-center flex-column position-relative align-items-center">
    <img class="home-banner" src="../Content/images/home-banner.png" alt="stray dog and cat">
    <p class="title1 mb-0">Could you take me home?</p>
    <p class="subtext1 mb-2">find your <span style="font-family: 'Open-Sans-Italic'" ;>fur</span>ever companion in hundreds of shelters in the country</p>
    @*<form class="form-search" action="/" method="post">
        <input class="home-search mx-auto rounded-5" type="search" placeholder="Search for a furiend near your City, Province, or ZIP" />
        <img class="search-icon" src="../Content/icons/Search.png" alt="Search icon" />
    </form>*@
</div>
<div class="d-flex directory justify-content-center">
    <div class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-center align-items-center">
        <img class="bg-white rounded-circle mb-3" src="../Content/images/home-dog.png" alt="Dog Icon" style="cursor: pointer" ng-click="redirectPets('Dog')" />
        <p class="directory-text">pup buddies</p>
    </div>
    <div class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-center align-items-center">
        <img class="bg-white rounded-circle p-3 mb-3" src="../Content/images/home-cat.png" alt="Cat Icon" style="cursor: pointer" ng-click="redirectPets('Cat')" />
        <p class="directory-text">meow furiends</p>
    </div>
    <div class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-center align-items-center">
        <img class="bg-white rounded-circle p-3 mb-3" src="../Content/images/home-volunteer.png" alt="Volunteer Icon" style="cursor: pointer" ng-click="redirectVolunteer()" />
        <p class="directory-text">help at a shelter</p>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center container1 gap-5">
    <img class="black-dog" src="../Content/images/home-blackdog.png" alt="Black Dog" />
    <div class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-center subcontainer1">
        <p>looking for a new fur-parent!</p>
        <p><span style="color: #B9375D; font-family:'Open-Sans-Bold';">Berry</span> is a 3-year-old mixed breed dog rescued from the streets. She’s gentle, loves cuddles, and gets along well with both people and other dogs.</p>
        <p>Unfortunately, Berry is currently in temporary foster care that can only last until the end of this month. Without a furever home, she risks going back to unsafe conditions. Don’t worry as Berry is...</p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2 ms-4 mb-3">
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center subsubcontainer1 gap-2">
                <img class="pink-paw" src="../Content/images/paw-pink.png" alt="Pink Paw" />
                <p class="mb-0">Fully vaccinated and spayed</p>
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center subsubcontainer1 gap-2">
                <img class="pink-paw" src="../Content/images/paw-pink.png" alt="Pink Paw" />
                <p class="mb-0">Friendly, affectionate, and loves children</p>
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center subsubcontainer1 gap-2">
                <img class="pink-paw" src="../Content/images/paw-pink.png" alt="Pink Paw" />
                <p class="mb-0">Healthy, playful, and ready for her furever family</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="mb-0">Adoption Deadline: Before December 21, 2025</p>
        <p class="mb-4">Location: Quezon City</p>
        <button class="adopt-btn" ng-click="redirectAdoptFormId(9)">adopt Berry today</button>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center container2">
    <p class="mb-1">interested in adopting?</p>
    <p class="mb-5">Adopting a pet is simple, but every step ensures that our rescued dogs and cats find safe and loving homes.</p>
    <div class="d-flex gap-5">
        <div class="subsubcontainer2">
            <img src="../Content/images/home-hand-paw.png" alt="Choose your pet" />
            <p>Choose Your Pet.</p>
            <p>Browse through our list of adoptable dogs and cats. When you find a furry furiend you’d like to welcome into your family, move on to the next step.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="subsubcontainer2">
            <img class="p-2" src="../Content/images/home-notebook.png" alt="Forms" />
            <p>Fill Out the Adoption Form.</p>
            <p>Complete our Google Form with your details, including your home environment, experience with pets, and contact information. This helps us review that our pets fit just right with their new home.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="subsubcontainer2">
            <img class="p-2" src="../Content/images/home-comms.png" alt="Communicate with us" />
            <p>Wait for Our Response.</p>
            <p>Our team will review your application and contact you through your email, cellphone number, or social media account within a few days. If your application is approved, we’ll arrange a meet-up so you can bond with your new furry buddy.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="d-flex container3 justify-content-center align-items-center">
    <div class="subcontainer3 d-flex flex-column">
        <p>become a volunteer!</p>
        <p class="mb-4">Not ready to adopt just yet? You can still make a big difference in the lives of our rescued dogs and cats by volunteering your time and care. Every hour you give means happier, healthier pets while they wait for their furever homes.</p>
        <p>As a volunteer, you can:</p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2 ms-4 mb-4">
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center subsubcontainer1 gap-2">
                <img class="pink-paw" src="../Content/images/paw-pink.png" alt="Pink Paw" />
                <p class="mb-0">Walk and play with the dogs</p>
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center subsubcontainer1 gap-2">
                <img class="pink-paw" src="../Content/images/paw-pink.png" alt="Pink Paw" />
                <p class="mb-0">Feed and comfort the animals</p>
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center subsubcontainer1 gap-2">
                <img class="pink-paw" src="../Content/images/paw-pink.png" alt="Pink Paw" />
                <p class="mb-0">Help clean and maintain the shelter</p>
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center subsubcontainer1 gap-2">
                <img class="pink-paw" src="../Content/images/paw-pink.png" alt="Pink Paw" />
                <p class="mb-0">Give love and socialization that every pet deserves</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="mb-5">Schedule your visit by pressing the button below.</p>
        <button class="volunteer-btn" ng-click="volunteerForm()">volunteer now</button>
    </div>
    <img class="home-volunteer-oval" src="../Content/images/home-volunteeroval.png" alt="Guy with Dogs" />
</div>
<div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center container4">
    <p class="mb-1">furiends that found their pawmilies</p>
    <p class="mb-5">From rescue to furever home, these furiends have found the love and care they deserve. Their happy endings inspire us every day.</p>
    <div id="success-stories" class="carousel slide">
        <div class="carousel-indicators">
            <button type="button" data-bs-target="#success-stories" data-bs-slide-to="0" class="active" aria-current="true" aria-label="Slide 1"></button>
            <button type="button" data-bs-target="#success-stories" data-bs-slide-to="1" aria-label="Slide 2"></button>
            <button type="button" data-bs-target="#success-stories" data-bs-slide-to="2" aria-label="Slide 3"></button>
        </div>
        <div class="carousel-inner">
            <div class="carousel-item active">
                <img src="../Content/images/home-carousel-1.png" class="d-block w-100" alt="">
                <div class="shadow-carousel"></div>
                <div class="carousel-caption d-none d-md-block">
                    <p class="z-3">From Stray to Family Protector</p>
                    <p class="z-3">Brownie was found wandering the streets, thin and scared of people. After weeks of care, he was adopted by the Santos family. Today, Max is a healthy, loyal guard dog who also loves cuddling with the kids. His favorite spot? Right at the foot of his new owner’s bed.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="carousel-item">
                <img src="../Content/images/home-carousel-2.png" class="d-block w-100" alt="...">
                <div class="shadow-carousel"></div>
                <div class="carousel-caption d-none d-md-block">
                    <p class="z-3">The Cat Who Learned to Trust Again</p>
                    <p class="z-3">Luna was rescued after being abandoned in a vacant lot. At first, she was shy and kept hiding. Thanks to her new mom, she slowly opened up and now spends her days napping on soft pillows and chasing toy mice. Luna has transformed into a playful and affectionate cat.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="carousel-item">
                <img src="../Content/images/home-carousel-3.png" class="d-block w-100" alt="...">
                <div class="shadow-carousel"></div>
                <div class="carousel-caption d-none d-md-block">
                    <p class="z-3">A Senior Dog’s Second Chance</p>
                    <p class="z-3">Buddy, a 7-year-old dog, was overlooked for months because of his age. Then one kind-hearted adopter decided seniors deserve love too. Now, Buddy enjoys peaceful walks, belly rubs, and cozy afternoons with his forever family—proof that it’s never too late for a happy ending.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <button class="carousel-control-prev" type="button" data-bs-target="#success-stories" data-bs-slide="prev">
            <span class="carousel-control-prev-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="visually-hidden">Previous</span>
        </button>
        <button class="carousel-control-next" type="button" data-bs-target="#success-stories" data-bs-slide="next">
            <span class="carousel-control-next-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="visually-hidden">Next</span>
        </button>
    </div>
</div>
<script src="../Scripts/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
<script>
    const navbar = document.getElementById("navbar");

    window.addEventListener("scroll", () => {
        if (window.scrollY > 650 && window.scrollY < 3740) {
            navbar.style.backgroundColor = "rgb(210, 93, 93)";
            navbar.style.boxShadow = "0px 3px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2)";
        } else {
            navbar.style.backgroundColor = "transparent";
            navbar.style.boxShadow = "none";
        }
    });
</script>
